  "limitations": [
    "The fixture container shares one cgroup between the driver, the owned workload, and the unrelated writer. The matching case tests record comparison, not exclusive run-domain ownership.",
    "The native launcher does not write the run-domain record yet, and the normal workflow does not require containment. Production integration is false.",
    "No native service manager, real Docker daemon, or disposable runner executed this cycle.",
    "Creation fencing, private Docker containment, storage durability, deadline and reserve bounds, hosted enforcement, maintainer ratification, and acceptance remain pending."
  ]
}
